    "name": "Bus-Occluded Child at a Signalized Crossing",
    "description": "On a green signal, ego approaches in the inside lane beside a stopped curbside bus. A child runs from the bus nose against the pedestrian phase, pauses at the lane line, then continues. Ego controls its approach and stops before the crossing despite a taxi closing from behind, remaining stopped until the entire crossing is clear.",
